 / theの違いですかね?","ts":"1625464975.195700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jo3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f085caa5-e7bc-48b4-9f43-dcc18014a88d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"theは完全特定でaだと概念グループ1(特定の対象1セットくらいの意味で)かなと","ts":"1625464889.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HfNMq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf40ff02-c11e-472e-a949-0edbb519d93d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"感覚ですが、学校とか組織なら `a number of~`人間とか、星とかの壮大なものが主語なら、 `numbers of` かな","ts":"1625464811.194400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yA+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a54c159-dfe4-4050-bbdb-916e35249a50","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"たいていの a/the の説明、 Specificity の話になってしまっていて、 Definiteness の説明がないですね…","ts":"1625464693.192700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U023KQQKC6T"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rk6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d63476c-8205-4401-ae30-317b489881f8","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"a と the\n\u003chttps://englishhub.jp/news/grammar-image-shinsei.html\u003e","ts":"1625464455.191900","attachments":[{"fallback":"English Hub: もう間違えない！冠詞の「the」と「a」は『核心のイメージ』で迷わず使い分け！ | 本・書籍・電子書籍 | おすすめ英会話・英語学習の比較・ランキング- English Hub","id":1,"title":"もう間違えない！冠詞の「the」と「a」は『核心のイメージ』で迷わず使い分け！ | 本・書籍・電子書籍 | おすすめ英会話・英語学習の比較・ランキング- English Hub","title_link":"https://englishhub.jp/news/grammar-image-shinsei.html","text":"英文法には自信があるという人でも、冠詞の「a」と「the」の使い分けに絶対の自信がある、と言い切れる人は少ないのではないでしょうか？ 今回は、アプリで受けられるオンライン講義「スタディサプリ」で「神授業」を展開する関正生...","image_url":"https://englishhub.jp/wp-content/uploads/2100/12/shutterstock_596512886.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1577224859,"service_name":"English Hub","service_icon":"https://englishhub.jp/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/icon_144x144.png","from_url":"https://englishhub.jp/news/grammar-image-shinsei.html","original_url":"https://englishhub.jp/news/grammar-image-shinsei.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ufe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A801001D-7BA7-4995-AA65-3FF17730C688","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"特定対象があるのはむしろ the では？","ts":"1625464287.191600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LIRF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87905c10-9b15-4660-8ed0-623ed026ae57","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"a があると、特定対象がある、ってイメージがあります（合っているか分からないけど）","ts":"1625464178.191000","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1625464189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gvf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1585704-0fed-4b65-bf98-787c5d5ae6f4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"a があることで、「～という漠然としたかたまり」感があるのかな...","ts":"1625461157.190400","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1625461175.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dnGbc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2af394be-c552-48a9-add9-dab815f98d9a","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"手元の辞書を見ると、さらに a  `形容詞` number of A と `形容詞` number of A という表現があるらしい (a の有無)\n\n\u0026gt; 形容詞＋numbers of Aが複数の集団を意識する場合に好まれるのに対し, a＋ 形容詞＋number of Aは漠然と種々雑多なものの集まりにも用い, Aがother, differentなどの 形容詞を伴う場合は特に 形容詞＋numbers of Aより普通\n日本語わからん","ts":"1625460924.189900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dZd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e198d014-06af-45d8-86b3-7081a2e15c3f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"本を何個か買った　って表現にかなり近いものを感じますね","ts":"1625458127.187700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCDdL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"523dea63-a742-4990-ad96-4b7b284d671c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど\nthe number of は、数そのものにフォーカスしているイメージがありますね","ts":"1625445581.187000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUiMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bddddceb-d51c-449b-b4f5-fed3c026f37e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"よく言われるのは a number of と the number of で意味が全然違う、ってやつですね","ts":"1625443830.186300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"prx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1E06792F-1973-493C-BC7A-9B699885BBBF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あとドキュメントでもよく見るか。数値という単位押しなのかな。","ts":"1625443218.185000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tEv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75DF465F-AE44-4592-9181-E8CFDD7B3DD2","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"なるほど","ts":"1625443147.184100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ViQeM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DA7A9B78-C2C1-4682-BA28-CBAA35258463","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"フォーマルかは知らないですけど、コミットメッセージでよく見ますね。","ts":"1625443135.183900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BtoJn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e0ea38d-8f95-4a49-b86d-ff4530565ee1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"many/someはふわっとしてるが、a number of xxx だとカウントはできる(けどしてない)感はある...","ts":"1625443133.183800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]},{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O1C7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"928057FF-7762-4A2B-A871-B7AF9BCFF2FF","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"nuber　ofって、フォーマルでよく使われるのかな","ts":"1625442943.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":fa